WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Xiao Xiao

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,560
This house is an apartment that my daughter bought by herself

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:08,160
You should know that to get married here, you need to prepare a car and a house, as well as a bride price, right?

4
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,080
How can you get married if you have nothing?

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,000
Blue girl gets married

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,160
It has always been the unspoken words of the parents.

7
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,760
Betrothal gifts are required, but dowry is also required

8
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:18,000
But what you call car science and housing have not been necessary positions since ancient times.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,080
Can this high-rise building be lived in?

10
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,320
You can live in two or three woolen huts

11
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,280
Why must I just say

12
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,160
Why does this guy feel like something is wrong?

13
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,640
Isn't what people said quite right?

14
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,520
Since you really love talking about those things, what are you doing?

15
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,720
If we talk about it, it’s not true love.

16
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,000
Then why are you getting married?

17
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,160
So I can't figure you out

18
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,000
Why are you screwing me like this for the rest of your life? Stop talking about it.

19
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,100
I'm full and I'm leaving

20
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,640
You bought a mobile phone

21
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,400
Let me use the mobile phone Peng Xian gave me.

22
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,320
Can I add your contact information and forward it to you?

23
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,440
The mobile phone belongs to Peng Xian

24
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:49,060
Say I can't use these or other mobile payments, okay?

25
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:53,340
Can you add a contact information?

26
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,340
Is this person mentally ill?

27
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,380
If someone replies to you, you will not be happy.

28
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,540
What they said is right
